ava --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `ava fork`, `ava exec`, and `ava exec fork`
ava fork --worktree: `ava fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
ava fork --worktree --last: `ava fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
ava exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `ava exec fork --worktree`
ava exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
ava resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `ava fork`, `ava exec`, and `ava exec fork`
ava archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `ava fork`, `ava exec`, and `ava exec fork`
ava queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `ava fork`, `ava exec`, and `ava exec fork`
